    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800580/extras/8d6294d8ed4240724d5932d82ecdef33.avif?t=1751916252\" data-has-big width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure to restore peace to the Fruit Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through challenging levels, face unique enemies, and battle imposing bosses to defeat the Veggies. Use special abilities and defeat King Cabbage!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800580/extras/905d3e44af7e14c9eaedd9184de662f5.avif?t=1751916252\" width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Challenge:</strong> Don\u2019t be fooled by the colorful visuals \u2014 <i>Mr. Tomato Adventures</i> demands precision, strategy, and serious skill to overcome its intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Test your abilities against unique bosses, each with their own patterns and special attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic 2D Platforming:</strong> Enjoy a platformer inspired by the classics, featuring responsive controls and fun mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny and Captivating Story:</strong> Follow Mr. Tomato on his mission to prove that, despite appearances, he\u2019s a fruit \u2014 and a true hero against the evil vegetables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Visuals:</strong> Explore a vibrant, detailed world brought to life with retro pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies:</strong> Battle against a wide range of villainous vegetables and uncover their weaknesses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to restore order and prove that a tomato can be a true hero?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800580/extras/8d6294d8ed4240724d5932d82ecdef33.avif?t=1751916252\" data-has-big width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure to restore peace to the Fruit Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through challenging levels, face unique enemies, and battle imposing bosses to defeat the Veggies. Use special abilities and defeat King Cabbage!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800580/extras/905d3e44af7e14c9eaedd9184de662f5.avif?t=1751916252\" width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Challenge:</strong> Don\u2019t be fooled by the colorful visuals \u2014 <i>Mr. Tomato Adventures</i> demands precision, strategy, and serious skill to overcome its intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Test your abilities against unique bosses, each with their own patterns and special attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic 2D Platforming:</strong> Enjoy a platformer inspired by the classics, featuring responsive controls and fun mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny and Captivating Story:</strong> Follow Mr. Tomato on his mission to prove that, despite appearances, he\u2019s a fruit \u2014 and a true hero against the evil vegetables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Visuals:</strong> Explore a vibrant, detailed world brought to life with retro pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies:</strong> Battle against a wide range of villainous vegetables and uncover their weaknesses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to restore order and prove that a tomato can be a true hero?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Save the Fruit Kingdom by facing Powerful Bosses! This is a challenging 2D game that requires Precision and Courage. Don\u2019t be fooled by the cute visuals \u2014 this game will test the most skilled players on the mission to save the Fruit Kingdom!",
